{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/c45c71108827418229fc3e6fab9c1603.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer <strong>Jia Xu (\u201cEggy\u201d)</strong> uses a cheat to beat a mysterious player called <strong>\u201cI Am God\u201d</strong> on stream\u2014and gets hit with an eerie \u201cpayback.\u201d That night he dreams a twin-tail girl blasts him\u2026 in the groin. Worse, he wakes up and realizes he\u2019s <strong>actually turned into a girl</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>Eggy</strong> has to survive in a <strong>men\u2019s dorm</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his inseparable best friend <strong>Monkey</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey\u2019s girlfriend <strong>Qin Lian</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the campus queen <strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> (same curse, frosty looks + tough-guy attitude), and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong>, a chaotic travel companion who used to be a sweet girl and is now a chubby boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll face key choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Wu Yangyang</strong> to hunt for \u201cI Am God\u201d and seek a way back, or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the present</strong>, keep living as a girl, and navigate the complicated feelings that may bloom between you and Monkey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are <strong>two distinct main routes</strong> with <strong>different stories and endings</strong>\u2014your choices decide the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9c73d5614f9dbdbfdf1c424dd8c7cac3.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jia Xu (\u201cEggy\u201d)</strong> \u2013 A small-time streamer who wakes up as a girl after a cheating incident. Airheaded with a dash of chunibyo; now forced to handle a wild new life in a girl\u2019s body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/fb12df23624bd74d8ac701bee1ae1e09.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey</strong> \u2013 <strong>Eggy</strong>\u2019s best friend and roommate. Goofy on the surface, fiercely loyal underneath. Tries to cover for his bro\u2019s \u201csudden change\u201d and gets pulled into all kinds of ridiculous situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9fe9848401ed272a9b244484aba3eb36.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qin Lian</strong> \u2013 Monkey\u2019s girlfriend, an anime-obsessed girl who takes <strong>Eggy</strong> in and becomes his first close female friend. With her help, <strong>Eggy</strong> slowly adapts to a new identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/db75e05d5fe2f3e891242b661730e70c.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> \u2013 The campus beauty with a <strong>Shaanxi-accented, tough-guy soul</strong>. She shares <strong>Eggy</strong>\u2019s predicament, and the contrast fuels endless comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/466bf8905b5ef813990f37912b6c0b97.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong> \u2013 A quirky companion met on the road. Once a cute girl, now a chubby boy whose antics make the journey even louder and livelier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/ea2d02f1ebc9c3914f1e196373e5e1cb.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI Am God\u201d</strong> \u2013 A mysterious figure who pops up across games and \u201cpunishes\u201d cheaters\u2014the mastermind behind the gender-swaps. Who she really is\u2014and why\u2014waits for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9830f1d7beb182b79475d127ab29f505.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/a09b95b7102127d52bf486ac9236603d.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully live-action, fully voiced</strong>: Real actors, real performances, real locations. Every beat\u2014joy, anger, grief, and love\u2014lands through on-camera acting for film-like presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid presentation</strong>: We weave three VN styles\u2014<strong>live-action character sprites</strong> for dialogue, <strong>polished CG stills</strong> for key moments, and <strong>short live-action clips</strong> for climaxes\u2014bringing a fresh look and feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two divergent life paths</strong>: Your <strong>binary choices</strong> steer <strong>Eggy</strong> onto very different routes, each with its own storylines and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh-out-loud contrast comedy</strong>: Gender misfires spark absurd events and big laughs\u2014while still making room for sincere thoughts on identity and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-save &amp; scene revisit</strong>: Auto-saves let you <strong>revisit completed scenes</strong> to try different options and see alternate endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join <strong>Eggy</strong> on a bizarre, gender-bending adventure? A live-action visual novel unlike any other is waiting for you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/76a0b4c84f233d24d2c8f0565674b961e9f366a0.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/0188ee1075de8638fef57550ba4689438399b35c.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/452bf5baac462b4a017944adda0f67a67d7efa24.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/8d14aa0869ab59b8141f887f333166856e7203f7.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/5b912a229f56d8be0ce1ea76850a6bdae5b7f33c.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/41b9356a69a858f8cd950d1629f24927e5e0b5ff.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/2aa90866f12f77c12ef8bccc934a4cbb87786ef0.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/c346f68380d53d975ae8466af46e0db3ff414e09.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/447ae5b8c8fd008f2e2d448c15a790e6387c71c1.jpg"},{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_11","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3516580/797548b71677c8b40a6445573af1e244ebd562cf.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516580?t=1762770648","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/629db8c73b6a7697eb18a27cc64d955078122887/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762770648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/7bb4c656fef5664036d6696fc0666393115a7907/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762770648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/7bb4c656fef5664036d6696fc0666393115a7907/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762770648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The content contained in this game may not be suitable for all age groups, or may not be appropriate to access during work hours: some nudity or pornographic content, common adult content, and some scenes containing back nudity or mild sexual innuendo."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Before You Play &amp; A Note from the Team</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/65ee1bf3e1370f850b30ba78f205349b.avif?t=1762770648\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made a visual novel that\u2019s a little\u2026 different. This time it\u2019s <strong>fully live-action</strong>\u2014real actors, real locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s also an <strong>interactive film-style experience</strong> presented as a visual novel: text + voice + animated stills tell a story that\u2019s both absurd and warm. There are <strong>no complicated inputs</strong> and <strong>no grindy unlock conditions</strong>\u2014we want you to relax and sink into the story. If you\u2019re willing, just sit back and let it play out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >like \u201codd-flavored\u201d crossovers of <strong>anime aesthetics + live-action</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can roll with <strong>gender-swap setups, contrast comedy, and bros facing messy feelings</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are looking for a <strong>chill, bite-sized</strong> visual novel,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or you\u2019re simply curious how far a <strong>live-action VN</strong> can go\u2014</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026then come along with <strong>Eggy</strong>. We know some players may expect a big-budget \u201cinteractive movie.\u201d We\u2019re not that. But we <strong>shot every scene with care</strong> and <strong>told a not-so-serious yet pretty fun story</strong>. If what you want is <strong>2\u20133 hours of light, pleasant company</strong>, you\u2019ll find it here in <strong>\u201cBallshit\u201d</strong>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/c45c71108827418229fc3e6fab9c1603.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer <strong>Jia Xu (\u201cEggy\u201d)</strong> uses a cheat to beat a mysterious player called <strong>\u201cI Am God\u201d</strong> on stream\u2014and gets hit with an eerie \u201cpayback.\u201d That night he dreams a twin-tail girl blasts him\u2026 in the groin. Worse, he wakes up and realizes he\u2019s <strong>actually turned into a girl</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>Eggy</strong> has to survive in a <strong>men\u2019s dorm</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his inseparable best friend <strong>Monkey</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey\u2019s girlfriend <strong>Qin Lian</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the campus queen <strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> (same curse, frosty looks + tough-guy attitude), and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong>, a chaotic travel companion who used to be a sweet girl and is now a chubby boy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll face key choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Wu Yangyang</strong> to hunt for \u201cI Am God\u201d and seek a way back, or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the present</strong>, keep living as a girl, and navigate the complicated feelings that may bloom between you and Monkey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">These are <strong>two distinct main routes</strong> with <strong>different stories and endings</strong>\u2014your choices decide the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9c73d5614f9dbdbfdf1c424dd8c7cac3.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jia Xu (\u201cEggy\u201d)</strong> \u2013 A small-time streamer who wakes up as a girl after a cheating incident. Airheaded with a dash of chunibyo; now forced to handle a wild new life in a girl\u2019s body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/fb12df23624bd74d8ac701bee1ae1e09.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey</strong> \u2013 <strong>Eggy</strong>\u2019s best friend and roommate. Goofy on the surface, fiercely loyal underneath. Tries to cover for his bro\u2019s \u201csudden change\u201d and gets pulled into all kinds of ridiculous situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9fe9848401ed272a9b244484aba3eb36.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qin Lian</strong> \u2013 Monkey\u2019s girlfriend, an anime-obsessed girl who takes <strong>Eggy</strong> in and becomes his first close female friend. With her help, <strong>Eggy</strong> slowly adapts to a new identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/db75e05d5fe2f3e891242b661730e70c.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wu Yangyang</strong> \u2013 The campus beauty with a <strong>Shaanxi-accented, tough-guy soul</strong>. She shares <strong>Eggy</strong>\u2019s predicament, and the contrast fuels endless comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/466bf8905b5ef813990f37912b6c0b97.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pangpang</strong> \u2013 A quirky companion met on the road. Once a cute girl, now a chubby boy whose antics make the journey even louder and livelier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/ea2d02f1ebc9c3914f1e196373e5e1cb.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI Am God\u201d</strong> \u2013 A mysterious figure who pops up across games and \u201cpunishes\u201d cheaters\u2014the mastermind behind the gender-swaps. Who she really is\u2014and why\u2014waits for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/9830f1d7beb182b79475d127ab29f505.avif?t=1762770648\" width=1144 height=866 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/extras/a09b95b7102127d52bf486ac9236603d.avif?t=1762770648\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully live-action, fully voiced</strong>: Real actors, real performances, real locations. Every beat\u2014joy, anger, grief, and love\u2014lands through on-camera acting for film-like presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid presentation</strong>: We weave three VN styles\u2014<strong>live-action character sprites</strong> for dialogue, <strong>polished CG stills</strong> for key moments, and <strong>short live-action clips</strong> for climaxes\u2014bringing a fresh look and feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two divergent life paths</strong>: Your <strong>binary choices</strong> steer <strong>Eggy</strong> onto very different routes, each with its own storylines and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh-out-loud contrast comedy</strong>: Gender misfires spark absurd events and big laughs\u2014while still making room for sincere thoughts on identity and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-save &amp; scene revisit</strong>: Auto-saves let you <strong>revisit completed scenes</strong> to try different options and see alternate endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join <strong>Eggy</strong> on a bizarre, gender-bending adventure? A live-action visual novel unlike any other is waiting for you!</p>","developers":["\u75af\u5154\u6e38\u620f\uff08FUNTOO Studio\uff09","Liquid Meow"],"dlc":[4012610],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516580/ae26746b1a9be794cf5d765dbe586045ddb9423f/header.jpg?t=1762770648","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516580/1670960066/829d80771806752156eae55136854c0d9f4e2564/1760690986/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760691743","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516580/1670960066/829d80771806752156eae55136854c0d9f4e2564/1760690986/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760691743","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516580/1670960066/829d80771806752156eae55136854c0d9f4e2564/1760690986/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760691743","id":257219151,"name":"Official PV - ENG","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219151/b343d04d27f058fc46947c267960bdec116de76e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760691743"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516580/1209301376/dd41c49bfafd75b98d78cefd7f4f29e31e199493/1760440697/dash_